{"id":"orbital-4c9dcb","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-1e36dfc6-f9d4-48b2-bc0d-642fd150a4a1","text":"**Summary** — Added `icon` prop to Badge via `IconProp` concern. Moved dot to trailing position (`ml-1.5`). Switched from `orb_template` to `call` method with `safe_join` (same pattern as Menu::Item). Updated demo with Icons, Icon with Dot, and reordered Status Dots sections.\n\n**Rationale** — `call` method needed because `render_icon` returns rendered HTML that can't be embedded in an `orb_template` string. Icon inherits `currentColor` from the badge variant — no separate tone prop needed.\n\n**Decisions made** — No `tone` prop for icons (deferred per spec). Icon spacing uses `.Orbital-Badge \u003e .Orbital-Icon` selector with `-ml-0.5 mr-1` for optical alignment.\n\n**Status** — All lint, style, and tests pass. Ready for review."},"created_at":"2026-07-28T07:13:08.033986Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.220 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@kuy.io\u003e","source":"mcp"}
